#
# The mediacore.notify scope's series (05-notify section 7, 05-metrics section
# 6 item 5): family<TAB>type<TAB>labels, checked by metricstest.AssertSeries in
# TestNotifyMetrics_SeriesGolden. Every label is bounded: instance is a
# configured channel, class and result are closed sets, adapter is a
# registered adapter, topic is a declared topic and severity one of five names.
mediacore_notify_dead_letters	gauge	instance
mediacore_notify_deliveries_total	counter	class,instance
mediacore_notify_delivery_seconds	histogram	adapter
mediacore_notify_published_total	counter	severity,topic
mediacore_notify_targets_total	counter	result,topic
